# game/code/e03/e03s04.rpy:741
translate korean e03s04_9a5b5588:

    # mc "And why did Lyssa go along with it? I don't think she has any weird delusions of grandeur."
    mc "그리고 리사는 왜 거기에 맞춰 준 걸까? 리사한테 그런 이상한 자아도취 같은 건 없을 텐데."

# game/code/e03/e03s04.rpy:744
translate korean e03s04_92235198:

    # sy "She has to have a plan, right?"
    sy "분명 무슨 계획이 있는 거겠지?"

# game/code/e03/e03s04.rpy:747
translate korean e03s04_fc93c498:

    # mc "Knowing Lyssa, she definitely does."
    mc "리사 성격 알잖아, 분명 있을 거야."

# game/code/e03/e03s04.rpy:750
translate korean e03s04_c1ef3a7a:

    # sy "I guess we should just go along with it for now?"
